This website was hand made in SvelteKit. I used Pixi.js to animate the clouds in WebGL, and Skeleton UI + Tailwind CSS for the UI components. The site precaches server-side-rendered pages to take advantage of static CDN speeds as much as possible. The backgrounds for this site were inspired by that feeling of geting past the clouds & rain and seeing something wonderful. All the background photos were shot by me in some of my favorite places on this planet. I hope you enjoy!
